From 4b16abf0b31deaee32e7eba57d7bad32c3fa648e Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Patrick Quinn <patrick.jm.quinn@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 21 Oct 2026 11:52:47 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] pilotd: local mode

[local] in pilotd.toml runs the standard backend on the phone: the LLM is
llama.cpp's llama-server on this machine, and LocalJev stands in for Jev,
handing the phone's own parsers what they do without a model and
everything else to the model. No relay, no Reef licence, no keys; replies
are stamped as processed on the device.
